# =====================================================================
# COMMIT MESSAGE TEMPLATE — step-by-step guide (side file)
# Lines starting with '#' are stripped by git and never committed.
# Follow the steps below. Edit only the lines WITHOUT a leading '#'.
# =====================================================================
#
# STEP 1 — Choose ONE commit type:
#   feature | fix | refactor | perf | test | docs | build | ci | chore | revert
#
# STEP 2 — Set the scope (optional but recommended): area touched.
#   Examples: agent, csp, graphql, deps, ci, security, model, view, git
#
# STEP 3 — Write the SUBJECT (first non-comment line), <=50 chars
#   (the trailing branch tag " (<branch>)" is NOT counted):
#   imperative mood, lowercase after the colon, NO trailing period:
#     <type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>
#
# STEP 4 — Leave ONE blank line, then an optional BODY (wrap at 72 chars)
#   explaining WHAT changed and WHY (not how). Add only if needed.
#
# STEP 5 — FOOTER (uncomment/add when applicable):
#   Refs: <TRACKING_ID>          <- filled in LATER from the other platform
#   Closes: #<issue>              (GitHub issue, if any)
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description> (only if the change breaks the contract)
#
# STEP 6 — Tracking IDs from the other platform go in the footer (Refs:).
#   They may be added later via the PR body or a follow-up commit.
#   NEVER amend already-pushed commits just to add an ID.
#   Remove any leftover "<TRACKING_ID>" placeholder before committing.
#
# =====================================================================
# WRITE YOUR COMMIT MESSAGE BELOW (keep lines <= 72 chars)
# =====================================================================
# The commit MUST end with the branch name in parentheses, e.g.:
#   feature(git): add commit and pr conventions (feature/6)
# The branch tag is NOT counted in the 50-char limit.

<type>(<scope>): <summary> (<branch>)

# Body (optional):


# Footer (uncomment and fill when applicable):
# Refs: <TRACKING_ID>
# Closes: 
# BREAKING CHANGE: 
